<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S&amp;K Famous started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S&amp;K Famous started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane said it initiated coverage of S&amp;K Famous Brands Inc, a Virginia-based retailer of men's apparel, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $17.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 9/16 to 11-5/16.</p>
</text>
